# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
# google-services.json deliberately NOT ignored (session 37) — it's a
# low-sensitivity client config file (an Android API key restricted by
# package name/SHA, not a real secret; the actual secret is the FCM V1
# service-account key, which never goes in this repo, only into EAS's own
# encrypted credential store). It's required at apps/mobile/google-
# services.json for the Google Services Gradle plugin to apply at build
# time (app.json's googleServicesFile) — EAS build's upload archive
# respects .gitignore, so leaving this ignored would silently ship a build
# without push notifications working, exactly the bug this file exists to
# fix. GoogleService-Info.plist (iOS) stays ignored — no iOS build exists
# for this project yet, nothing to commit.
GoogleService-Info.plist

